# The vendored esp-sr blobs (~13 MB of .a archives + the 285 KB packed
# srmodels.bin) live outside git — scripts/fetch_esp_sr.py downloads them
# from the ESP Component Registry on first build. That keeps a checkout of
# this repo well under the size it would balloon to if the blobs lived in
# history. The library.json + include/ + src/ (source-controlled) already
# describe the interface and one .c file, which is all the rest of the
# firmware links against.
libs/
models/srmodels.bin
